{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. First, if object approached, take it and move to destination. Then, if object visible, approach it and check properties. Finally, search for object. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = SearchForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />",
